CP2K 2026.2 (git:c92cc08) aborts k-point symmetry when no Bloch phase
preserves overlap covariance at a half-cell image. Upstream
7b6f4dd061754e37c41e190ef48877c08126206a, PR #5646, merged 2026-08-03,
replaces those pbc calls with pbc_stable.

Commit author: Dynamics of Condensed Matter <30792324+DCM-Uni-Paderborn@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: Thomas D. Kuehne <tkuehne@cp2k.org>

The raw commit misses one declaration in qs_neighbor_lists.F because
c92cc08 wraps that line differently. This patch adds my_stable_images
on the following line and leaves the 2026.2 wrapping in place.
